Output docs/assets/games/rs-nim.gif
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1020
Set Height 560
Set Padding 10
Set TypingSpeed 0
Hide
Type "clear && games/rs-nim/target/release/rs-nim --lang en replay games/rs-nim/examples/records/classic-1357.nimrec --interval 900"
Enter
Sleep 300ms
Show
Sleep 17s
